From 778afbf989754e7f64b337f870430a436dd13d3c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 19:00:08 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 28/65] 0027-vela-dx11-sgsr3: DX11 games get Vela's models over
 the DX11 -> DX12 bridge: sgsr3_12 (SGSR3FeatureDx11on12: SGSR 3 with the FSR
 4 VK bridge, FSR 4 Fast, the NPU path), FSR 3.1 by ffx_12, SGSR 2 by
 sgsr2_12; the Vela live file switches them per handle like DX12 (same log
 lines); a DX11 backend that fails goes to SGSR 2 on Adreno

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
(cherry picked from commit 2f929c71021f9acfe0e85733ddca1aff234c3bbc)
